<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Come forward to the Holiest;</l><l>With God, in oneness, pray;</l><l>The precious blood’s applied again,</l><l>God’s economic way.</l><l>Anointing oil applied upon</l><l>Both altars clearly shows:</l><l>The move of God’s eternal grace</l><l>Between two altars flows.</l><l>The fire from heaven, which came down</l><l>To burn the offered Son,</l><l>Becomes the fire to incense burn,</l><l>As fragrance to God’s throne;</l><l>The sweetness we experience</l><l>Through Christ’s inclusive death,</l><l>Is sweetness unto God through our</l><l>Ascending, praying breath.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
